            "text": "Hello, West St. Paul :)\nLocal Effort is excited to announce the first drop of our frozen pizza line. These 100% midwest pizzas are ready to bake, and almost like eating one fresh from one of our Gozneys. "
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
