        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "639fd6d28e9c",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Every ingredient* in this pizza is grown or produced in the Midwest. Our pizza is agri-cultural. It's also fun and delicious, and a little rough around the edges. "
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "d526092d49d1",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "3244d9a7a079",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "We use tomatoes from local farms, and canned tomato sauce from Dei Fratelli in Ohio. We use Rochdale Mozzarella and Widmer Brick on our cheese pizzas. Our crusts are made primarily with Bolles and Durum from Bakers Field."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "0364f4feec3b",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "4eb59dbe3cd1",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "*alongside our sourdough leavener, we use bobs red yeast, is what it is."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      }
    ],
